Here are short, crisp, and to-the-point measurable benefits ready to copy and paste directly into your email to Sagar and your practice lead:

---

**Key Quantifiable Benefits of the AWS Solution:**

* 
**95% Faster Dispute Processing:** Cuts low-value (sub-£25) dispute resolution timelines from **3 to 5 days down to less than 5 seconds** via automated straight-through processing.


* 
**80% Reduction in Training Overhead:** Lowers manual policy reading times from **2 hours down to 15 minutes** per document using AI-generated summaries and quizzes.


* 
**40% Reclaimed Team Capacity:** Automatically verifying merchant receipts frees up senior analysts to focus on high-value, complex fraud investigations instead of manual data checking.


* 
**100% Audit-Ready Compliance:** Eliminates manual tracking by automatically saving timestamped training logs and quiz scores directly into AWS databases.


* **Reduced Processing Costs:** Shifting to an AWS serverless architecture ensures the bank only pays per transaction, driving the infrastructure cost per claim down to fractions of a penny.
